Z||000003||2xsess||09-08-2000||05:48 PM||||Will someone please explain to me what the point of having the tires stick out from the fenders like that? I love to lowered cars and trucks as much as the next guy. But why do people do that? don't they realize that it puts more stress on the wheel bearings and other important stuff? I lived in Florida for a while and I saw all types of cars like that. Even Camaros and the like!!!<BR>Looks stupid to me!!!<P><BR>Sorry had to get it out!||||reg||1
