Z||000005||DaRkLoRD||09-08-2000||08:11 PM||||I saw a car at college here this morning with about 4 pine tree air fresheners hanging from the rearview mirror... LOL<P>there's also an ESCORT(!!) with "Ford Performance" painted right across the side of the car, windshield banner, lowered, big wheels, etc..<P>as well as a couple of cavaliers with painted headlights, big exhaust tips, etc..<P>and one car had a wing that was at least 8" tall.. not a new record of course, but still funny.. oh, and there's an old VW beetle here.. lowered, metallic blue paint, windows tinted so dark you can't see inside it.. and a single exhaust tip (3"-4" diamater, cone shaped....) sticking about 12" out the back, right in the center...... lol...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>and I saw one of the most hilarious ricers EVER about 2 weeks ago... I got some pics of it, I'll post them when I get my film developed... (I hope the photos turned out good.. it wasn't very good lighting conditions and I didn't use a flash) <BR>This one is good enough to go on riceboypage.com but you'll all get a sneak preview before anyone else.. hehehehe..<P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||1
