Z||000010||Oreif||09-09-2000||02:13 AM||||I saw a car that had the tires sticking out like that going down the highway one day. Soon after getting on the highway the driver of the car found out what happens when you apply that much pressure on your CV joints.<BR>He managed to limp his now 3-wheeled ricer to the side of the road and started looking for his tire assembly! Funniest thing I ever saw! <BR>To Hugh and Phil, I think you are seeing the left front tire also so it makes the left rear look larger. (of course this is just a guess)<p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 09-09-2000).]||||reg||1
