Z||000013||contra||09-09-2000||02:09 PM||||those guys are idiots!<BR>man o man!<P>they're missing out on the biggest performance enhancers ever! They're forgetting about the white tail lights, fake cell phone antenna on the roof, tinted windows (that gives you an extra 10HP, proven and tested on a dyno!), VtEC or even better VTEK stickers, and they're not sitting low enough in the car, they need to have at least 2 feet of head room above them so they can balance the weight of the car better. LOL<P>ok i hope you all know i'm kidding<BR>if not<BR>shame on you  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>||||reg||1
